              "expression": "let\n    Source = Excel.Workbook(File.Contents(\u0022C:\\Data\\Mini.xlsx\u0022), null, true),\n\n    Sales_Table = Source{[Item=\u0022Sales\u0022,Kind=\u0022Table\u0022]}[Data]\nin\n    Sales_Table"
